From: forge-shepherd <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 19:01:31 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat(dashboard): mono-brutalist reskin + multi-harness Live
 Ops + live/phase (v3)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Aesthetic → mono / Swiss-brutalist: strict black/white/gray (no accent),
flat (no shadows/gradients/glows), sharp corners, hard 1px rules, mono type.
Grayscale encodings: priority = fill density, status/health = glyphs, selected
= inverted. Light + dark both grayscale.

Live Ops → multi-harness: top-line counts (actors/live-claims/worktrees/PRs),
per-actor breakdown of what each agent is on, worktrees grouped by inferred
surface (claude-code/worktree/t3code/ephemeral/main), open PRs, and an explicit
seam for session_id/worktree_id/harness/region (kernel lease fields not yet in
the CLI read surface).

Live pulse: pulsing filled square on open+claimed items (board cards, epic-row
rollup, overview, Live Ops). Lifecycle phase: 6-cell mono stepper (plan..verify)
derived best-effort from status/claim; seam for the real currentStage field.

Generator adds worktree surface + actors count + liveSeam. app.test.js covers
isLive + lifecyclePhase + epicRollup.live (10 tests). In-browser verified:
grayscale-only, independent column scroll, no body h-scroll.

Refs: 21cc7139-b088-4e23-a69c-82840e170394

